  "plain": "In 1996, a US Air Force plane is said to have landed at Campinas in Brazil while helicopters picked something up from Varginha, a Brazilian town where a strange creature was reportedly captured that year. A witness named Jose Fernandez tells it on the strength of what he says he knows, \"the US Air Force made a landing in Campinas,\" with the film Moment of Contact and the former Pentagon official Luis Elizondo in the background, and it would mean the United States had a hand in taking whatever was found."
